  tag: CORPORATE INTELLIGENCE
  objective: Recover the ownership archive from Research vault.
  condition: 'Recover an optional archive for +15 XP. Below 65%: quiet bonus.'
  aftermath: The shell company belongs to Aegis. A private security contract is turning public research into private leverage.
