  lore:
  - id: glasshouse/0
    title: Beneficial owners
    company: HELIX DYNAMICS
    contract: Glasshouse
    text: 'Ownership schedule: Helix''s research subsidiary pays a holding company for exclusive deployment rights. That holding company has no staff. Its sole voting shareholder is Aegis Systems.'
  - id: glasshouse/1
    title: The backup lane
    company: HELIX DYNAMICS
    contract: Glasshouse
    text: 'Retirement plan for legacy storage: Decommissioning postponed again. The backup lane carries compliance snapshots that the current board cannot delete without countersignature. Someone quietly renewed its certificate.'
  - id: glasshouse/2
    title: An unsigned dedication
    company: HELIX DYNAMICS
    contract: Glasshouse
    text: 'An early prototype carries a handwritten dedication: For the people who keep the lights on. The production specification omits the inscription. The archive preserves a photograph.'
